<title>USA: Baker Hughes, Petrolite merger waiting period ends.</title>
<headline>Baker Hughes, Petrolite merger waiting period ends.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baker Hughes Inc and Petrolite Corp said Monday the waiting period under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Antitrust Improvements Act of 1976 with respect to Baker Hughes' acquisition of Petrolite expired without requests for additional information.</p>
<p>Baker Hughes provides products and services for the oil, gas and process industries. Petrolite is a specialty chemical company.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
